properties.description:
Variance

The Project will consist of the following programmatic requirements:
 
	Removal of the existing roof and existing roof framing; 
	Creating approximately 531 square feet of habitable space above the existing first floor framing and foundation;
	Incorporating a complete with a master suite in the second story addition; 
	Construct a new staircase from the existing finished first floor to the new finished second floor;
	Creating a new roof with material to be determined;

